  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "Tencent Hunyuan 3 (295B mixture-of-experts, 21B active, Apache-2.0) as kodelow's NVFP4 W4A16 quantization (routed experts 4-bit, MTP layer preserved, Marlin kernels) on two Sparks with vLLM tensor parallel 2, native MTP speculative decoding (1 token), FP8 KV, eager execution, 128K context and hy_v3 tool and reasoning parsers. Basis: tonyd2wild's recipe. Upstream ran an unpublished local image (vLLM 0.23.1rc1.dev190); this recipe uses the published digest-pinned build of the same vLLM (0.23.1rc1.dev190+gab6660699) and applies upstream's ':opensource' special-token parser patch at build time. Upstream launches with Ray; this recipe uses the platform's native multi-node mp executor, which upstream did not test. The upstream repository declares no licence file. Upstream figures (21.8 tok/s single stream, 59.7 tok/s aggregate at six streams) are claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending.",
    "tags": [
      "hunyuan",
      "hy3",
      "marlin",
      "mtp",
      "nvfp4",
      "reasoning",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "vllm"
    ],
    "title": "Hunyuan 3 (Hy3) 295B NVFP4 MTP vLLM two Sparks"
  },
